# Keep the build context small and free of anything that never belongs in an image. `target/` is
# the largest offender; `store/` and `people/` hold records that must never enter a layer (they are
# gitignored for the same reason). The Dockerfile COPYs only what it needs, but a lean context also
# speeds the buildx cache and removes any chance of an accidental COPY of the above.
target/
store/
people/
.git/
.github/
helm/
docs/
tests/
fixtures/
rehearsal/
*.md
